WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.920
a derived type does not automatically

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.420
inherit the physical data bindings

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.200
of its parent.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.820
It needs its own specific data

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.439
bindings mapped to the tables.
